"""
The cloud-profile C driver-stack domain as a package derivation
(docs/spectrum_plan.md §8.3, Sprint 8 task 8.5).

Data-only recipe, the C-flavour sibling of HermitDomain: it pins the
build facts read firsthand from the `../hermit-c/` checkout — the
`x86_64-hermit-gcc` cross toolchain (the `hermit-os/hermit-gcc` image)
linking `libhermit.a` from the kernel's xtask, and the kernel feature
list that `meson.build` pins for C workloads (`acpi,dhcpv4,dns,mman,
newlib,smp,tcp,udp,virtio-net,loader`, `pci` except riscv64).

`sources` is empty and `builder_symbol` is `hermit.build` with an
explicit `BUILDER_STATUS` row, for the same recorded reasons as
HermitDomain: there is no image payload to hash here (the `kernel/` git
submodule of hermit-os/kernel is not checked out in this workspace), and
no unikernel-building builder exists here (machine offline). Capable-host
steps live in docs/spectrum_plan.md §8 (task 8.4).

Exported through `austral compile … --pkg-totality=true
--emit-derivations=plan.json` and hashed by `avm-pkg drv-hash`, same
release contract as the seed package set (PLAN_avm_pkg §4.8).
"""
import Derivation (
    Derivation
);

module HermitCDomain is
    constant hermit_c_domain: Derivation;
end module.
